OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy and dry to start for
OL,6,Fmany but with coastal showers
OL,7,Finitially. Turning brighter through
OL,8,Fthe morning and feeling pleasant in
OL,9,Fsunny spells. Showers develop during
OL,10,Fthe day, but these will be isolated
OL,11,Fand lighter than on Sunday. Freshening
OL,12,Fwinds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FAny lingering showers ease to
OL,15,Fleave a dry, partly cloudy evening.
OL,16,FRemaining partly cloudy with clear
OL,17,Fspells overnight and dry for most
OL,18,Fareas. Feeling cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
