OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA partly cloudy and dry start
OL,6,Fto the day. Isolated showers may
OL,7,Fdevelop mainly over the Dales, but
OL,8,Fmany areas see a dry, if cooler, day.
OL,9,FFresh winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHeavy
OL,12,Frain crosses the area through
OL,13,FWednesday morning, with blustery
OL,14,Fshowers to follow. Drier on Thursday
OL,15,Fbefore further rain then showers on
OL,16,FFriday. Fresh mainly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
